# SPA fallback (spec §6.1). Cloudflare Pages matches in this order: Pages
# Functions (functions/api/*, functions/auth/*) first, then existing static
# files (assets, messages, index.html), then these _redirects rules. So this
# catch-all only ever serves real client routes (e.g. /en/vehicles) the app
# router resolves; it never shadows the proxy Functions or hashed assets.
